abstract: >-
  Evidence-first R&D sandbox for DUP Protocol (DUP Labs) — hybrid Python + Rust L1:
  rust-libp2p (ADR 0019), Long-Range / weak-subjectivity labs (ADR 0017), and EVM depth.
  Formerly Absolute Blockchain Experimental. Not the industrial audit-freeze pin;
  not a launched public mainnet. Copyright Uladzimir Dabranski (D.U.P.) / DUP Labs.
